// The Insights tab: two things a plan cannot tell you about itself.
//
//   Estimates     - EFFORT against the clock, per tag, project, file or
//                   person: how far off, which way, and what to multiply by.
//   Dependencies  - cycles, chains held up behind one task, things still
//                   WAITING on something finished, AFTERs naming nothing,
//                   ORDERED projects stuck at a step.
//
// Both answers are the server's (/insights/estimates, /insights/deps; the same
// ones `orgs estimates` and `orgs deps` print). The page only asks and draws,
// and the one write it offers - taking a dependency away - is the gantt's own
// unlink op, so it is undone the same way.

